@Thorns_HostAddress = http://localhost:5234
@token = cole_um_jwt_aqui
@userId = 1

### Cadastro público (cria somente usuário comum)
POST {{Thorns_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Novo Usuário",
  "email": "novo.usuario@example.invalid",
  "password": "senha-segura"
}

### Consultar o próprio perfil (usuário autenticado)
GET {{Thorns_HostAddress}}/api/Users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Atualizar o próprio perfil
PUT {{Thorns_HostAddress}}/api/Users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Usuário de Teste",
  "email": "usuario.teste@example.invalid",
  "cpf": "529.982.247-25",
  "cep": "01001-000"
}

### Listar usuários (somente Admin)
GET {{Thorns_HostAddress}}/api/Users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Consultar usuário por ID (somente Admin)
GET {{Thorns_HostAddress}}/api/Users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Atualizar usuário por ID (somente Admin)
PUT {{Thorns_HostAddress}}/api/Users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Usuário de Teste",
  "email": "usuario.teste@example.invalid",
  "cpf": "52998224725",
  "cep": "01001000",
  "role": "User",
  "password": null
}
